From: tomaszstaniak <68373859+tomaszstaniak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 22:10:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] xad: LZX: store the pure bit as FIBF_PURE, not FIBF_ARCHIVE

Problem: a file archived by LZX with the pure flag set comes out of
xadmaster with the archive flag instead. A listing of xfi_Protection
shows "---arwed" where LZX itself shows "--p-rwed", and a program that
applies xfi_Protection to the extracted file loses the pure flag and
gains a spurious archive flag.

Reproduce: on an Amiga (or under amitools' vamos) set the pure flag on a
file (`Protect Tool +p`), run `LZX a test.lzx Tool` with LZX 1.21, then
list test.lzx through xadmaster.library and look at xfi_Protection of
the entry: bit 4 (FIBF_ARCHIVE) is set, bit 5 (FIBF_PURE) is not.

Cause: clients/LZX.c defines its own copy of the AmigaDOS protection
bits and gets one wrong: XADFIBF_PURE is (1<<4), which is FIBB_ARCHIVE.
In <dos/dos.h> FIBB_PURE is 5. The LZX header bit itself
(LZXHDR_PROT_PURE, bit 7) is read correctly. The same define is in
libxad 13.0, so the bug predates the AROS import.

Change: define XADFIBF_PURE as (1<<5).

Tested: AROS ABIv11 x86_64 (GCC 10.5.0, SDK-202609) under QEMU, xad from
contrib be30bc6ad linked statically into a test program. The archive was
made by LZX 1.21 with three entries flagged script, pure and read-only,
each with a comment. Listing and extracting it:
- without the patch, on the ABIv11 2026.09 base: Tool came out "--arwed";
- with the patch, on the 2026.09 base and on AROS One 1.3: Tool came out
  "-p-rwed"; script, read-only and the comments were unchanged.
LhA archives with the same flags were extracted identically before and
after. Not built or run for mainline (ABIv1).

Repository: contrib (https://github.com/aros-development-team/contrib)
Base: be30bc6ad191303ca8753bd3f15e4c78b1278f57
Requires: none
Scope: all platforms that build xad; the define is not platform-specific
Upstream-Status: candidate (not submitted)
Removal: drop when the pinned contrib base contains the fix
---
 workbench/libs/xad/portable/clients/LZX.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/workbench/libs/xad/portable/clients/LZX.c b/workbench/libs/xad/portable/clients/LZX.c
index 12534c05..ddaf0f64 100644
--- a/workbench/libs/xad/portable/clients/LZX.c
+++ b/workbench/libs/xad/portable/clients/LZX.c
@@ -148,7 +148,7 @@ XADRECOGDATA(LZX)
 #define XADFIBF_EXECUTE (1<<1)
 #define XADFIBF_WRITE   (1<<2)
 #define XADFIBF_READ    (1<<3)
-#define XADFIBF_PURE    (1<<4)
+#define XADFIBF_PURE    (1<<5)
 
 XADGETINFO(LZX)
 {
